rong>12.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-young-man">年轻男子</a> by Dr Gears</p> <blockquote> <p>头骨置在最高的叠床上，正对着门口。十根白得刺眼的手指骨插在裂开的眼窝里。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>13.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-meaning-of-fear">恐惧的含义</a> by Weizhong</p> <blockquote> <p>“你害怕吗，博士？”</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>14.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/until-death">至死不渝</a> by psul</p> <blockquote> <p>老人立在那里，身下的瓷砖开始液化，黑色的液体淋漓滴落。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>15.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/michael-the-kiler">撒手michael</a> by pastarasta1</p> <blockquote> <p>天哪，现在的人为了搏关注都干的什么事，丢死人了。</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p><strong>16.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/someareborntoendlessnight">生于无尽黑暗之中</a> by Tufto</p> <blockquote> <p>它就像无线电塔，能把我们的梦境发送出去，把我们的梦境变成真的。这片黑暗就是这样运作的。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>17.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/ii-tab-po-c-h20-qhs-prn-pain">ii tab po c h2o qhs prn pain</a> by Veiedhimaedhr</p> <blockquote> <p>她想象着一具满是蛆虫，不用肺呼吸的尸体呼唤她的名字。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>18.</strong> <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/tyrone-joins-the-family">tyrone-joins-the-family</a> by kinchtheknifeblade</p> <blockquote> <p>“Last question. Do you have any history of insectophobia?”</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>19.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/substation-9">九号变电所</a> by The Great Hippo</p> <blockquote> <p>如果你们觉得在一个巨大的地下设施里工作的时候，心里清楚自己同事被淹死的尸体就在脚下的某个地下坑洞里，听起来很可怕的话……好吧，你们说得对。</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>20.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/clockwork-time">发条时间</a> by Dr Gears</p> <blockquote> <p>它向人群发出尖嚎，公主睡裙的碎屑夹在它肉体的皱褶中，小头冠陷在应该是鼻子的空洞之中。</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p><strong>21.</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/recruitment-drive-28126">招聘活动(R-28126)</a> by MayD</p> <blockquote> <p><span style="font-family:Microsoft YaHei">安保人员 Emilio Delgado Ruiz15签订了一份有效期4002年的合同，将会永久地在东南印第安纳州分发中心当安保人员。</span></p> </blockquote> <p><